‎
‎**Technology is application. 
‎Business is application.
‎Wealth is application.**
‎
‎But application without principle becomes consequence without wisdom.
‎
‎## The Leaf as Reminder
‎Creation offers possibilities.
‎Humanity bears responsibility for how those possibilities are explored, cultivated, and lived.
‎
‎## Mantra
‎**Discover. Then discern.**
‎**Build. Then ask if we should.**
‎**Move fast. Then ask where we're going.**
